dialect protocol
protocol stdio.pptx.mutations
version 1
schema stdio.pptx
start record

# FG-wave: REAL binary op frame (`format u8 | tag u8 | variant payload`), replacing F1's
# `print_op().into_bytes()` text-as-binary shortcut (`../../🦀️.rs`'s old
# `OpBinary::encode_op`/`decode_op`). `tag` is the `PptxMutation` variant ordinal, in the SAME 0-8
# order `print_pptx_mutation`'s own keyword match uses (`NoMutation`=0, `SetSnapshot`=1,
# `InsertSlide`=2, `RemoveSlide`=3, `MoveSlide`=4, `InsertShape`=5, `RemoveShape`=6,
# `SetShapeText`=7, `SetShapePosition`=8) -- both REAL fixed fields, individually protocol-walked,
# matching `📜️docx/…/🧬️mutations/💾️binary/📡️.protocol.semio`'s own `format`/`tag` header
# shape (restated here, per-artifact tag assignment).
#
# Past that header, the variant's own payload is one opaque trailing `bytes` chain: several
# variants (`InsertSlide`/`SetSnapshot`'s whole `PptxSnapshot`, `InsertShape`'s `shape: PptxShape`)
# carry the SAME genuinely recursive/data-carrying payloads `../🔺️diff/💾️binary/
# 📡️.protocol.semio` already hits (`protocol-prim-ref-recursion`,
# `📖️grammar-recipe.md` §5) -- once ANY variant's payload is structurally unwalkable, bundling
# every variant's payload into the SAME opaque tail (rather than partially structuring only the
# simpler, flat-field variants like `RemoveSlide`/`MoveSlide`) is the honest, minimal-surface
# choice, same reasoning `../🔺️diff/💾️binary/📡️.protocol.semio`'s own doc comment gives.
#
# The Rust `encode_op`/`decode_op` side stays genuinely, fully structured past this header -- real
# LEB128-varint-framed index/collection encoders and recursive per-variant binary sub-encoders
# (`enc_snapshot_bin`/`enc_opc_package_bin`/`enc_slide_bin`/`enc_shape_bin`/`enc_paragraph_bin`,
# `../../🦀️.rs`'s own `🔖️OpBinaryCodec` region), reusing this artifact's
# `../🔺️diff/🦀️.rs` `pub(crate)` binary primitives (`write_str_lp`/`read_str_lp`/
# `write_bytes_lp`/`read_bytes_lp`/`enc_shape_bin`/`dec_shape_bin`/`enc_slide_bin`/`dec_slide_bin`/
# `enc_transform_bin`/`dec_transform_bin`/`enc_part_bin`/`dec_part_bin`/`enc_rel_bin`/`dec_rel_bin`)
# rather than re-deriving them a second time -- round-trip tested independently of this protocol
# description, same honest-boundary treatment `📖️grammar-recipe.md` §2.5 documents.
framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8
chain payload bytes
